[[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3237784\">1048A50</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and move the relay holder backet (1b) away\nfrom the battery drip tray.</p><p>2. Disconnect and remove the hose from the flow meter to the turbocharger\nair inlet pipe from the air flow meter.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2015060.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the hose from the flow meter to the\nturbocharger air inlet pipe.</p><p>Place the relay holder bracket back in\nits housing and fix it using the bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237784\">1048A50</a></p>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237784\">1048A50</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Loosen collar (1a) and remove the air intake sleeve from flowmeter\n to turbocharger air intake pipe (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069042.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the sleeve from flowmeter to turbocharger\nair intake hose back in its housing and tighten the band.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237784\">1048A50</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237784\">1048A50</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Loosen the band and remove the hose from the flowmeter to turbocharger\nair intake pipe.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069478.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the hose from flowmeter to turbocharger\nair intake hose back in its housing and tighten the band.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237784\">1048A50</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]